  "description": "Seo Minjae, who recently treated his hyperhidrosis at a mysterious clinic, now possesses a strange power no one can quite explain. To manage its lingering symptoms, he turns to the campus rehabilitation club, Care, for an affordable solution. To join, he must pass an initiation test: a one-on-one massage session in front of the club president. The catch? His massage partner is none other than Yoo Ara, a judo major who once slammed him into the ground after mistaking him for the campus pervert. Now, Minjae must use his mysterious power to pull off the ultimate act of persuasion.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
